   "body": "**Adversarial review (Claude Fable 5.1, ext/bybifok-fable-review-9, independent of the author): APPROVE** — head f45ef8f7\n\nNo findings. The round commit `b12143fc` closes the three Lows and the Nit of my review on 6b62bd2e; the merge `f45ef8f7` is clean.\n\n**Checked** (fresh worktree at f45ef8f7, removed afterwards; nothing posted)\n- `swift build --build-tests` clean, no warnings in touched files; `swift test --skip-build`: 5 targets green, 1 253 tests (261 + 424 + 160 + 188 + 220). `ConcurrentLoginTokenTests.alertFormKeepsFresherToken` passes with both cases (same account, account switch).\n- The three surviving mutations are now caught: `updateHashCheck(token)` without `since:` fails `alertFormKeepsFresherToken` (4 issues: token overwritten, `hashChecks` not empty); `number >= 0` fails `refusedLinks` on `post=0` and `numreponse=0`; `hasSuffix(\"modo.php\")` fails `refusedLinks` and `otherAction` on `/modo.php` and `/x/user/modo.php` (8 issues). Each file reverted after its probe.\n- Round commit: only `ModeratorAlertFlow.swift` (two comments), `ModeratorAlertPrepareTests.swift` (+4 links, +2 actions) and `ConcurrentLoginTokenTests.swift` (+1 test) change; no behaviour change; no line over 140.\n- Merge resolution: no conflict markers in the tree; `git diff origin/dev-swift...f45ef8f7` holds only the lot's 17 files, so nothing from `dev-swift` (8c59262) was altered or dropped; CHANGELOG-LEGACY has rows 50 (#350) and 51 (#352's video row, already on `dev-swift`) then 53 for this lot, 52 left to #352's branch; the spec's three mentions (l.74, 76, 78) say 53; HFR-PROTOCOL §6c keeps `### LOT-035 — video links` (l.452) and `### LOT-050 — moderator alert` follows (l.459).\n- `scripts/check-lot-deps.py`: 153 lots, 0 violations.\n- Security verdict unchanged from 6b62bd2e: the POST goes only to an action parsing to the same target as the link, redirects not followed, sent once, no success claimed, no token or cookie in any error.\n",
